WEBVTT

00:18:58.184 --> 00:19:01.804
You increase paralysis,
and you decrease satisfaction.

00:19:01.828 --> 00:19:03.493
Everybody needs a fishbowl.

00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:06.344
This one is almost
certainly too limited --

00:19:06.368 --> 00:19:09.373
perhaps even for the fish,
certainly for us.

00:19:09.397 --> 00:19:13.865
But the absence of some metaphorical
fishbowl is a recipe for misery

00:19:13.889 --> 00:19:15.674
and, I suspect, disaster.

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:17.270
Thank you very much.

00:19:17.294 --> 00:19:18.936
(Applause)